# Docker context nodejs/ (the example images: docker build -f nodejs/example/node-*/Dockerfile nodejs).
# Host installs and build output may hold another platform's files: never sent.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
spike/
test/
packages/*/test/
**/*.md
**/.DS_Store
# Secrets — defensive (never in the repo).
**/.env*
# npm pack output anywhere except tarballs/, which Dockerfile.demo copies.
**/*.tgz
!tarballs/*.tgz
